DESCRIPTION:FREE EVENT! Spend the day at the Pawtucket River enjoying exci
 ting dragon boat races\, live cultural performances\, delicious authentic 
 cuisine\, and the crowd-favorite dumpling eating contest! Stay tuned for m
 ore info &amp\; learn more at: https://bvtcri.org/dragonboats This event i
 s made possible thanks to the Luke Charitable Foundation and is produced b
 y Blackstone Valley Tourism Council to showcase Asian culture and reacquai
 nt people to the rivers of Rhode Island's Blackstone Valley.\n\nSource: ht
 tps://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/25th-ri-chinese-dragon-boat-races-%26
 -taiwan-day-festival/111426/
LOCATION:Festival Pier\, 21 Tim Healey Way\, Pawtucket\, RI 02860
