UID:1a78a9072fc24a568e21a7f8a4d8@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Darik and The Funbags live at Ballard’s brings pure party en
 ergy to Block Island for a beach day that turns into a full on singalong. 
 If you want a fun crowd\, a packed patio\, and a set that keeps people mov
 ing from the first song to the last\, this is the kind of show you plan yo
 ur day around at Ballard’s. Known for feel good vibes and a playful stag
 e presence\, Darik and the Funbags deliver a fast moving mix of crowd favo
 rites that keeps the whole place engaged. Expect familiar choruses\, big m
 oments\, and the kind of live performance where everyone is singing along 
 even if they just walked in. Whether you are here with friends for the wee
 kend or making the most of a day trip\, Darik and the Funbags live at Ball
 ard’s fits perfectly with the energy of Block Island.\n\nSource: https:/
 /www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/darik-and-the-funbags-live-at-ballard%e2%8
 0%99s/110507/
